    (Q.comap (algebraMap (TypeDensity.BlowupChart R t x) (TypeDensity.BlowupOverlap R t x))), ∀ a : TypeDensity.BlowupChart R t x, Φ
    (TypeDensity.completedPointMap (TypeDensity.BlowupOverlap R t x) Q
